	<row id="msg_0749_00216" index="216">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Hits harder the more\nloyal the user is.\n</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00217" index="217">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">A gift bomb. Might\nhurt, might heal. Who\nknows.\n</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00218" index="218">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Big mad. Hits harder\nthe less the user\nlikes you.\n</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00219" index="219">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Hires security. No\nstatus problems for 5\nturns.\n</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00220" index="220">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Splits the bill. Both\nsides share their HP\nevenly.\n</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00221" index="221">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Can I get an amen?\nHoly fire from the\nheavens. Often burns\nthe foe.\n</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00222" index="222">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">A giant bass flops all\nover the block.\nRandom strength. Hits\neverybody.\n</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00223" index="223">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Lights an M-80 by the\nfoe. Confuses them if\nit lands.\n</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00224" index="224">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Rams the foe with a\npolice bullhorn.\n</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00225" index="225">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Eats a raw onion and\nbreathes on the foe.\nMay paralyze.\n</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00226" index="226">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Passes it off to a\nteammate, stat\nchanges and all.\n</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00227" index="227">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Run it back. The foe\nrepeats its last move\na few turns.\n</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00228" index="228">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Chases down a foe\ntrying to switch out.\nDouble damage.\n</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00229" index="229">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Laps round the foe on\na BMX. Clears traps\nlike thumbtacks.\n</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00230" index="230">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Way too much cologne.\nLowers evasion. Draws\nwild homies outside.\n</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00231" index="231">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">A wrecking ball. May\nlower the foe’s\nDefense.\n</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00232" index="232">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Brass knucks. May\nraise the user’s\nAttack.\n</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00233" index="233">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Not on the list.\nBounced out the club.\nGoes last but never\nmisses.\n</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00234" index="234">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Snooze, snooze, then\nrise and grind.\nRestores HP depending\non the weather.\n</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00235" index="235">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Ring light, flashes,\nglow up. Restores HP.\n</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00236" index="236">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Lays out under the\nmoon with a tanning\nreflector. Restores\nHP.\n</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00237" index="237">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Pulls the hidden\nstrap. Its type\ndepends on the user.\n</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00238" index="238">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Strings a clothesline\nand the foe runs into\nit. Lands critical hits\neasy.\n</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00239" index="239">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">A tornado. May make\nthe foe flinch.\n</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00240" index="240">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Makes it rain for 5\nturns. Water moves\nget stronger.\n</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00241" index="241">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Beach chair,\nreflector, sun up for\n5 turns. Fire moves\nhit harder.\n</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00242" index="242">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">A hollow point round.\nMay lower the foe’s\nDefense.\n</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00243" index="243">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Mirror tint on the\nwindows. Special\nattacks bounce back\ndouble.\n</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00244" index="244">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The hype man gets\nthem going, copying\nthe foe’s stat\nchanges.\n</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00245" index="245">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The getaway, on a\nrental scooter. Goes\nfirst with a hard hit.\n</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00246" index="246">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">OG power. May raise\nall of the user’s\nstats.\n</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00247" index="247">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Rolls a Magic 8-Ball at\nthe foe. Outlook not\ngood. May lower Sp.\nDef.\n</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00248" index="248">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Has a premonition. The\nhit lands two turns\nlater.\n</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00249" index="249">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Smash and grab. May\nlower the foe’s\nDefense.\n</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00250" index="250">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Flushes the foe down\na swirl for two to five\nturns. Clears\nwhirlpools outside.\n</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00251" index="251">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The whole crew pulls\nup, one at a time.\n</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00252" index="252">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Crossover,\ncrossover, ankles\ngone. First turn only.\nFlinches.\n</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00253" index="253">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Turns up for three\nturns. Nobody sleeps.\n</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00254" index="254">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Stacks pancakes. Up\nto three. Raises\nDefense and Sp. Def.\n</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00255" index="255">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Spits the bars stored\nup. More Stockpile,\nmore damage.\n</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00256" index="256">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Takes the L. Swallows\nit whole and heals off\nwhat it stockpiled.\n</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00257" index="257">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Cranks the\nthermostat to 99. May\nburn the foe.\n</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00258" index="258">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">A bag of ice bursts in\nthe sky. Hails on\neverybody for five\nturns.\n</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00259" index="259">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Clowns on the foe so\nbad they can’t use\nthe same move twice in\na row.\n</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00260" index="260">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Gasses the foe up till\nthey’re confused.\nRaises their Sp. Atk.\n</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00261" index="261">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Flicks a Bic at the\nfoe. Burns them.\n</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00262" index="262">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Faints, but the RIP\ntee hits so hard the\nfoe’s Attack and Sp.\nAtk drop way down.\n</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00263" index="263">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Stunts in a rental.\nHits harder when\nburned, poisoned or\nparalyzed.\n</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00264" index="264">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Squares up for a fair\none. Fails if the user\ngets hit first.\n</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00265" index="265">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">A gym sock under the\nnose. Double damage if\nthey’re paralyzed.\n</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00266" index="266">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">“LOOK AT ME.” Every\nfoe has to target the\nuser.\n</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00267" index="267">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The bodega cat\nhandles it. Changes\nwith the spot.\n</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00268" index="268">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Plugs in the amp. Next\nElectric move hits\ntwice as hard.\n</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00269" index="269">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Drops a diss track.\nThe foe can only\nattack.\n</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00270" index="270">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The secret\nhandshake. Powers up\nan ally’s move.\n</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00271" index="271">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Shell game. The foe\nalways picks wrong.\nSwaps held items.\n</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00272" index="272">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">A cheap costume of\nthe foe. Copies its\nAbility.\n</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00273" index="273">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Blows out the\nbirthday candles.\nHeals next turn.\n</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00274" index="274">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Tags in a random\nteammate’s move.\n</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00275" index="275">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Posts up in a lawn\nchair. Heals every\nturn but can’t leave.\n</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00276" index="276">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Maxes out on\neverything, even the\nvending machine.\nLowers Atk and Def.\n</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00277" index="277">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Hops in a bouncy\ncastle. Status moves\nbounce right back.\n</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00278" index="278">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Digs through the\nrecycling. Gets back a\nused item.\n</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00279" index="279">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Their name’s on the\nlist. Double damage if\nthe user got hit this\nturn.\n</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00280" index="280">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Karate chops through\nbricks. Breaks the\nfoe’s Reflect and\nLight Screen.\n</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00281" index="281">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Reads them the terms\nand conditions. They\nfall asleep next turn.\n</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00282" index="282">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Sells the foe a\nbootleg. It falls\napart in their hands.\nKnocks off their item.\n</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00283" index="283">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Rise and grind. Cuts\nthe foe’s HP down to\nmatch the user’s.\n</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00284" index="284">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Its phone blows up.\nStronger the more HP\nthe user has.\n</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00285" index="285">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Trades cards with the\nfoe. Then trades\nspots. Swaps\nAbilities.\n</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00286" index="286">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Locks up every move\nthe foe shares with\nthe user.\n</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00287" index="287">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Scrubs the kicks\nclean. Heals burn,\npoison and paralysis.\n</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00288" index="288">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The foe’s photo on\nthe dartboard. If the\nuser drops, that\nmove’s PP drops too.\n</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00289" index="289">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Scam calls the foe.\nSteals their healing\nor stat move and uses\nit.\n</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00290" index="290">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">An inside job. Its side\neffect depends on the\nspot.\n</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00291" index="291">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Cannonballs into the\nkiddie pool, then\nsplashes up under the\nfoe.\n</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00292" index="292">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Shoves the foe off\nwith a push broom, 2-5\ntimes.\n</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00293" index="293">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Hi-vis vest and a\nclipboard. Blends in\nanywhere. Changes\ntype.\n</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00294" index="294">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Bonnet off, edges\nlaid. A whole glow up.\nDrastically raises Sp.\nAtk.\n</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00295" index="295">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Flicks the brights on\nthe foe. Blink, blink,\nFULL BEAMS. May lower\nSp. Def.\n</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00296" index="296">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The club fog machine,\ncranked all the way.\nMay lower Sp. Atk.\n</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00297" index="297">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">A pillow fight till the\npillow bursts. Sharply\nlowers the foe’s\nAttack.\n</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00298" index="298">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Does the Wobble.\nEverybody on the\nfloor gets confused.\n</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00299" index="299">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Tiptoes over hot\nasphalt, then a\nflaming kick. High crit\nratio. May burn.\n</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00300" index="300">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Spa day in a mud bath.\nWeakens Electric\nmoves.\n</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00301" index="301">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Packs and throws\nsnowballs for five\nturns, harder each\nhit.\n</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00302" index="302">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Swab, needle, jab. May\nmake the foe flinch.\n</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00303" index="303">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Kicks back in the\nrecliner. Restores\nhalf its max HP.\n</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00304" index="304">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Hypes so loud it\nhurts. Yeah! What!\nOkay!\n</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00305" index="305">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Feeds the foe gas\nstation sushi. May\nbadly poison.\n</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00306" index="306">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Grabbed by the claw\nmachine. May lower\nDefense.\n</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00307" index="307">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Lighter fluid on the\ngrill. Too much. The\nuser rests next turn.\n</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00308" index="308">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Cracks the fire\nhydrant wide open.\nThe user rests next\nturn.\n</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00309" index="309">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">A slam dunk from\norbit. May raise the\nuser’s Attack.\n</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00310" index="310">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">You’ve been served.\nMay make the foe\nflinch.\n</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00311" index="311">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Shakes a snow globe\nof the block till the\nweather inside goes\nwild, then throws it.\n</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00312" index="312">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Hangs up air\nfreshener trees.\nHeals the team’s\nstatus.\n</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00313" index="313">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Crocodile tears.\nSharply lowers the\nfoe’s Sp. Def.\n</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00314" index="314">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">A ceiling fan on HIGH\nflings its blades. High\ncritical-hit ratio.\n</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00315" index="315">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Burns the toast.\nSmoke alarm going off.\nSharply lowers the\nuser’s Sp. Atk.\n</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00316" index="316">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Calls the K9 unit.\nGhosts get hit and\nevasion gets ignored.\n</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00317" index="317">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">A dump truck buries\nthe foe in gravel.\nLowers Speed.\n</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00318" index="318">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">A glitter bomb. It’s\nnever coming out. May\nraise all stats.\n</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00319" index="319">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">A fork on a\nchalkboard. Sharply\nlowers the foe’s Sp.\nDef.\n</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00320" index="320">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Candles, roses, a slow\njam. The foe falls\nasleep.\n</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00321" index="321">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">A feather duster. The\nfoe can’t stop\nlaughing. Lowers\nAttack and Defense.\n</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00322" index="322">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The galaxy durag goes\non. Raises Defense\nand Sp. Def.\n</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00323" index="323">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Pumps a giant water\ngun. Stronger the\nmore HP the user has.\n</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00324" index="324">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Finds full bars and\nblasts the foe with\nwifi. May confuse.\n</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00325" index="325">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Sneaks up in a\ncardboard box. Never\nmisses.\n</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00326" index="326">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">A giant eye opens in\nthe sky and reads\ntheir future. May\nmake the foe flinch.\n</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00327" index="327">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">An uppercut that\nsends the foe to the\nmoon.\n</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00328" index="328">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Stacks sandbags\naround the foe for\ntwo to five turns.\n</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00329" index="329">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Puts the foe on ice.\nIf it hits, they’re a\ncold case.\n</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00330" index="330">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">A car through the\npuddle at the bus\nstop. May lower\naccuracy.\n</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00331" index="331">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Spits sunflower seeds\nlike a machine gun,\ntwo to five times.\n</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00332" index="332">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">An ace shot that\nnever misses.\n</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00333" index="333">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Chips off ice with an\nice pick, 2-5 times.\n</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00334" index="334">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Pot on the head,\nbaking sheet up.\nSharply raises\nDefense.\n</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00335" index="335">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Blocked. The foe\ncan’t leave.\n</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00336" index="336">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">AWOOO - the whole\ncrowd howls back.\nRaises Attack.\n</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00337" index="337">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">A giant lobster claw.\nClamps on. Old Bay\neverywhere.\n</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00338" index="338">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Plants bullets. Grows\na garden of guns. The\nuser rests next turn.\n</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00339" index="339">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Hits the gym. Raises\nAttack and Defense.\n</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00340" index="340">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Pogos off the top of\nthe screen, lands on\nthe foe’s head next\nturn. May paralyze.\n</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00341" index="341">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">A mud pie to the face.\nLowers the foe’s\nSpeed.\n</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00342" index="342">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">A subway rat whips\nthe foe with its tail.\nMay poison.\n</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00343" index="343">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">“Lemme see that real\nquick.” Walks off with\nthe foe’s item.\n</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00344" index="344">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Grabs a downed power\nline and charges. Big\nrecoil. May paralyze.\n</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00345" index="345">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Bills fly out the fanny\npack. Never misses.\n</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00346" index="346">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Super Soaker and the\nsprinkler dance.\nWeakens Fire moves.\n</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00347" index="347">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Cucumbers on the\neyes. Raises Sp. Atk\nand Sp. Def.\n</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00348" index="348">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Edges the foe with a\nweed whacker. Lands\ncritical hits easy.\n</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00349" index="349">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Does the shmoney\ndance. Raises Attack\nand Speed.\n</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00350" index="350">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Pebbles at their\nwindow, two to five\ntimes. You up?\n</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00351" index="351">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Rubs a balloon on its\nhead. The static\nnever misses.\n</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00352" index="352">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">A water balloon to the\ndome. May leave the\nfoe dazed and\nconfused.\n</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00353" index="353">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Black cat, broken\nmirror, then the sky\nfalls two turns later.\n</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00354" index="354">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Mind blown. Sharply\nlowers the user’s Sp.\nAtk.\n</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00355" index="355">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Crashes on an air\nmattress. Heals half\nits HP.\n</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00356" index="356">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Everybody’s pants\nsag for five turns.\nNobody’s flying\nanywhere.\n</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00357" index="357">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Night vision goggles.\nGhosts can’t hide.\nEvasion ignored.\n</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00358" index="358">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The alarm, then the\nchancla. Double\ndamage on a sleeping\nfoe.\n</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00359" index="359">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Whack-a-mole, but the\nfoe’s the mole.\nLowers the user’s\nSpeed.\n</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00360" index="360">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Flings a gold fidget\nspinner. Stronger the\nslower the user is.\n</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00361" index="361">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Makes a wish on a\nshooting star and is\ngone. The next one in\ngets fully healed.\n</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00362" index="362">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Salt in the wound.\nDouble damage if the\nfoe is under half HP.\n</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00363" index="363">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Throws the fruit it’s\nholding. Type and\npower depend on the\nfruit.\n</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00364" index="364">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Breaks the foe’s\nankles. Hits even\nthrough Protect or\nDetect.\n</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00365" index="365">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Grabs the foe’s berry\nwith a reacher. Eats\nit.\n</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00366" index="366">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Tailgate party.\nDoubles the team’s\nSpeed for a few\nturns.\n</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00367" index="367">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">A coin in the mall\nmassage chair.\nSharply raises a\nrandom stat.\n</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00368" index="368">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Takes the hit, then\npays it back with\ninterest.\n</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00369" index="369">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Hits on an e-scooter,\nthen pulls a U-turn\nand swaps out.\n</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00370" index="370">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">A throwdown. Lowers\nthe user’s Defense\nand Sp. Def.\n</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00371" index="371">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Gets back at the foe:\ntheir stuff out on the\nlawn. Twice as hard if\nit moved first.\n</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00372" index="372">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Insurance payout.\nDouble damage if the\nfoe’s already hurt.\n</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00373" index="373">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Caution tape and an\nevidence bag. The foe\ncan’t use items.\n</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00374" index="374">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Tosses the held item\nat the foe.\n</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00375" index="375">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Hot potato. Passes\nits status problem to\nthe foe.\n</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00376" index="376">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Plays the reverse\ncard. Stronger the\nless PP it has left.\n</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00377" index="377">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">“You’re cut off.” The\nfoe can’t heal for\nfive turns.\n</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00378" index="378">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Shakes the foe down.\nStronger the more HP\nthey got.\n</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00379" index="379">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Flips the script:\nswaps Attack and\nDefense.\n</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00380" index="380">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">A gas station hot dog.\nThe foe’s Ability is\nout of commission.\n</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00381" index="381">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Rubs the rabbit foot.\nThe team can’t take\ncrits for five turns.\n</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00382" index="382">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Skips the whole line\nand uses the foe’s\nmove first, harder.\n</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00383" index="383">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Plays a burned CD of\nthe last move used.\n</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00384" index="384">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Pre-workout for the\nfoe’s chamomile: swaps\nAttack and Sp. Atk\nchanges.\n</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00385" index="385">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Good umbrella for the\nfoe’s busted one:\nswaps Def and Sp. Def\nchanges.\n</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00386" index="386">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Time out in the\ncorner. Hits harder\nthe more the foe’s\nstats went up.\n</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00387" index="387">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Out of options.\nThrows the kitchen\nsink. Only works after\nevery other move.\n</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00388" index="388">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">3 a.m. thoughts. The\nfoe can’t sleep.\n</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00389" index="389">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">A cheap shot before\nthe foe attacks. Goes\nfirst.\n</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00390" index="390">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Scatters rusty nails.\nPoisons foes that\nswitch in.\n</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00391" index="391">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Swaps mood rings with\nthe foe: all stat\nchanges trade places.\n</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00392" index="392">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Kicks back on a pool\nfloat. Restores a\nlittle HP every turn.\n</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00393" index="393">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Hops on a hoverboard\nand somehow it floats.\nImmune to Ground\nmoves for five turns.\n</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00394" index="394">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Rides a flaming\nshopping cart into the\nfoe. Big recoil. May\nburn.\n</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00395" index="395">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">A stiff arm to the\nface. May paralyze.\n</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00396" index="396">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Farms aura pose by\npose, then throws all\nof it. Never misses.\n</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00397" index="397">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">A full car detail.\nSharply raises Speed.\n</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00398" index="398">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">A dirty shiv. May\npoison the foe.\n</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00399" index="399">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Pure dark vibes off a\nblack candle. May\nmake the foe flinch.\n</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00400" index="400">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Lights out, then slash\nmarks. High\ncritical-hit ratio.\n</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00401" index="401">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Snaps the foe with a\nwet durag.\n</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00402" index="402">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Ch-ch-ch-chia. Grows\na whole chia afro on\nthe foe till it bursts.\n</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00403" index="403">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">A flurry of past due\nbills. May make the\nfoe flinch.\n</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00404" index="404">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Salon shears. Snip,\nsnip. Leaves a bald\nspot.\n</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00405" index="405">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">One mosquito. The foe\nslaps themself. May\nlower Sp. Def.\n</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00406" index="406">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The parade dragon\ndances in.\nFirecrackers\neverywhere.\n</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00407" index="407">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Rush hour stampede\noff the subway. May\nmake the foe flinch.\n</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00408" index="408">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Fires a beam off the\nuser’s chain.\n</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00409" index="409">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Taxes the foe with a\npunch. Heals half the\ndamage dealt.\n</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00410" index="410">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">High noon. Draws\nfirst. Always goes\nfirst.\n</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00411" index="411">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">A firework mortar. Big\nblast, bad aim. May\nlower Sp. Def.\n</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00412" index="412">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Shotguns an energy\ndrink, fires the\ncaffeine. May lower\nSp. Def.\n</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00413" index="413">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Cape on, goggles\ndown, off the roof of\nthe projects. Full\nsend. Big recoil.\n</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00414" index="414">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The manhole blows and\nlaunches the foe. May\nlower Sp. Def.\n</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00415" index="415">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Shell game with two\nbags. Swaps held items\nwith the foe.\n</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00416" index="416">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Plows into the foe in\nan 18-wheeler. The\nuser has to recover\nnext turn.\n</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00417" index="417">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The conspiracy board.\nIt’s all connected.\nSharply raises Sp.\nAtk.\n</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00418" index="418">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Works the speed bag,\nthen the foe. Always\ngoes first.\n</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00419" index="419">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">A snow plow dumps a\nwall of snow. Twice as\nhard if hit first.\n</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00420" index="420">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Flicks ice cubes from\nthe cup. Always goes\nfirst.\n</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00421" index="421">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Claws rip up out of\nthe foe’s shadow. High\ncritical-hit ratio.\n</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00422" index="422">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Jumper cables to the\nfoe. May paralyze or\nflinch.\n</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00423" index="423">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Chugs a slushie, brain\nfreeze, icy chomp. May\nfreeze or flinch.\n</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00424" index="424">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">A hot grill bite. May\nburn or flinch.\n</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00425" index="425">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Footsteps behind the\nfoe. Always goes\nfirst.\n</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00426" index="426">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">A pigeon drops one\nright on the foe’s\nhead. May lower\naccuracy.\n</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00427" index="427">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Throws shade.\nLiterally: a\nlampshade, spinning.\nHigh crit ratio.\n</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00428" index="428">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Rings the singing bowl,\nthen a full-speed\nheadbutt. May make\nthe foe flinch.\n</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00429" index="429">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Spinner rims catch the\nsun right in the foe’s\neyes. May lower\naccuracy.\n</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00430" index="430">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">A disposable camera\nflash. Seeing spots.\nMay lower Sp. Def.\n</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00431" index="431">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Parkours off\neverything and lands\non the foe. May\nconfuse them.\n</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00432" index="432">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Opens a window and\nfans out the fog with\na pizza box. Lowers\nthe foe’s evasion.\n</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00433" index="433">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Hits SLOW on the\nremote. The slow move\nfirst for five turns.\n</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00434" index="434">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Meteors. Then a\nbigger one. Sharply\nlowers the user’s Sp.\nAtk.\n</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00435" index="435">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Six cords, one outlet.\nShocks everybody.\nMay paralyze.\n</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00436" index="436">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The lava lamp erupts\non everybody. May\nburn.\n</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00437" index="437">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">A storm of zaza. Hits\nhard but sharply\nlowers the user’s Sp.\nAtk.\n</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00438" index="438">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Goes and gets the\nextension cord.\n</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00439" index="439">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">A wrecking ball. Third\nswing hits. The user\nrests next turn.\n</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00440" index="440">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Tags the foe with a\ndirty spray-paint X.\nHigh crit ratio. May\npoison.\n</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00441" index="441">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The garbage truck\nunloads on the foe.\nMay poison.\n</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00442" index="442">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">A steel core round.\nMay make the foe\nflinch.\n</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00443" index="443">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">A giant magnet drags\nthe foe in and the\nhubcaps pile on. Never\nmisses.\n</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00444" index="444">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Shades on, rocks up.\nHigh critical-hit\nratio.\n</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00445" index="445">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">A smooth pickup line.\nSharply lowers Sp.\nAtk of the other\ngender.\n</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00446" index="446">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Lays a spike strip on\nthe foe’s side. Hurts\nanybody who swaps in.\n</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00447" index="447">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Gets the foe laced.\nThe heavier they are,\nthe harder they fall.\n</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00448" index="448">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Yaps nonstop till the\nfoe’s head spins. May\nconfuse.\n</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00449" index="449">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Court’s in session.\nThe gavel comes down.\n</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00450" index="450">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Bed bugs. If the foe’s\nholding a Berry, the\nuser eats it.\n</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00451" index="451">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Charges the phone to\n100% and fires. May\nraise Sp. Atk.\n</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00452" index="452">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Measures twice, then\njust swings the\ntwo-by-four. Big\nrecoil.\n</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00453" index="453">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Jet ski to the face.\nAlways goes first.\n</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00454" index="454">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Order placed. Every\ndelivery driver in the\ncity pulls up. High\ncrit ratio.\n</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00455" index="455">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Mall cops on segways\nsurround the user.\nRaises Defense and\nSp. Def.\n</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00456" index="456">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Honey in the tea.\nHeals half its max HP.\n</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00457" index="457">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Headbangs straight\ninto the foe. Huge\nrecoil.\n</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00458" index="458">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Ding ding. Two quick\njabs.\n</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00459" index="459">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Clocks out so hard\ntime stops. The user\nrests next turn.\n</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00460" index="460">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Unzips space itself.\nLands critical hits\neasy.\n</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00461" index="461">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Moonwalks off for\ngood. The one who\ncomes in next gets\nfully healed.\n</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00462" index="462">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Into the trash\ncompactor. Stronger\nthe more HP the foe\nhas.\n</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00463" index="463">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Flamin’ hot chips, the\nwhole bag. Traps the\nfoe for a few turns.\n</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00464" index="464">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The whole block’s\nlights go out. The\nfoes fall asleep in the\ndark.\n</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00465" index="465">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Pollen count:\nEXTREME. Sneezes so\nhard it hurts. May\nsharply lower Sp. Def.\n</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00466" index="466">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Somebody let one go in\nthe elevator. May\nraise all the user’s\nstats.\n</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00467" index="467">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Ghost rides the whip.\nVanishes, then hits\nnext turn.\n</language>
	</row>
</body>
